I come out of the supermarket.
Outside, there is a vegetable cart.
There is a lot of crowd at the cart.
I go near the cart.
There are very fresh vegetables there.
I look at the vegetable vendor.
I say to the vendor, "Bhaiya, I want tomatoes."
The vendor asks, "Madam, how many tomatoes do you want?"
I say, "I want one kilo of tomatoes."
The tomatoes are very red and fresh.
I really like these red tomatoes.
I pick out the good tomatoes myself.
Then I see the spinach.
The spinach is very green.
I tell the vendor, "Bhaiya, I want spinach too."
"I want one bunch of spinach."
The vendor puts the vegetables in my bag.
I like fresh vegetables a lot.
